70
00:05:06,160 --> 00:05:09,460
Walk about 500 meters without trying to conceal your presence.

71
00:05:09,460 --> 00:05:11,940
Aim for that pillar.

72
00:05:12,280 --> 00:05:13,800
Once you get there, use Zetsu.

73
00:05:13,980 --> 00:05:15,600
Then get back here immediately.

74
00:05:15,980 --> 00:05:16,400
Right.

75
00:05:16,640 --> 00:05:17,760
Stalking the stalker, huh?

76
00:05:22,380 --> 00:05:22,940
Huh?

77
00:05:23,880 --> 00:05:25,700
