94
00:06:24,240 --> 00:06:30,780
You see, that was my scissorhands' barber slasher!

95
00:06:30,780 --> 00:06:36,400
And now, I'm gonna eat it.

96
00:06:36,400 --> 00:06:43,940
And when I consume the hair I cut, I learn things about its owners that they don't even know

97
00:06:43,940 --> 00:06:44,940
