98
00:06:44,940 --> 00:06:45,940
I absorb everything!

99
00:06:45,940 --> 00:06:46,940
I absorb everything!

100
00:06:46,940 --> 00:06:51,940
Muscle tone, potential for disease, genetic strengths.

101
00:06:51,940 --> 00:06:57,940
I'll learn everything there is about your body before I start to toy with it.

102
00:06:57,940 --> 00:06:58,940
