113
00:08:15,880 --> 00:08:20,040
The first thing I saw was that guy being flipped through the air me, too

114
00:08:20,600 --> 00:08:22,600
Her opponent wasn't weak at all

115
00:08:23,160 --> 00:08:25,160
She's just that powerful

116
00:08:25,400 --> 00:08:29,480
If he were an in-game character, he'd be difficulty rank D

117
00:08:29,480 --> 00:08:33,000
