267
00:17:02,520 --> 00:17:07,060
Training pays off that much more when you're fighting for your life against one of your equals.

268
00:17:07,060 --> 00:17:15,300
Damn it.

269
00:17:18,740 --> 00:17:19,660
Damn it.

270
00:17:23,480 --> 00:17:24,080
No.

271
00:17:25,300 --> 00:17:27,120
This isn't the life I wanted.

272
00:17:27,720 --> 00:17:29,260
I never asked for this.

273
00:17:33,700 --> 00:17:35,740
I warned you, didn't I?

274
00:17:35,740 --> 00:17:38,820
You were the one who suggested that we take a shortcut.

275
00:17:39,220 --> 00:17:40,500
So it's my fault?

276
00:17:40,780 --> 00:17:42,040
Just look at my clothes.

277
00:17:42,120 --> 00:17:43,120
They're covered in filth.

278
00:17:44,660 --> 00:17:47,520
It's not like I was asking for a reward or anything.

279
00:17:48,220 --> 00:17:50,460
I didn't even expect to thank you.

280
00:17:51,740 --> 00:17:52,740
I just...

281
00:17:55,480 --> 00:17:58,280
Enough already.

282
00:18:00,600 --> 00:18:02,320
There's no way I can beat you.

283
00:18:03,320 --> 00:18:04,260
Just kill me.

284
00:18:04,260 --> 00:18:06,780
But why would we want to do that?

285
00:18:07,000 --> 00:18:08,560
We've gotten a whole lot better.

286
00:18:08,800 --> 00:18:10,220
And it's all thanks to your help.

287
00:18:10,580 --> 00:18:12,640
So thank you, Mr. Pinalt.

288
00:18:14,060 --> 00:18:15,260
All I wanted...

289
00:18:15,260 --> 00:18:19,680
was to live as a decent human being.

290
00:18:24,100 --> 00:18:25,280
You may go.

291
00:18:25,280 --> 00:18:29,820
I'll go turn myself in.

292
00:18:34,500 --> 00:18:35,080
Gon...

293
00:18:35,080 --> 00:18:37,620
You certainly are a flawless specimen.

294
00:18:38,140 --> 00:18:42,120
But that purity of yours is going to make this quite the balancing act.

295
00:18:45,120 --> 00:18:45,680
Okay.

296
00:18:46,080 --> 00:18:47,980
It's time we head to Masadora.

297
00:18:48,400 --> 00:18:48,900
Us!

298
00:18:48,900 --> 00:18:51,280
The number nine!

299
00:18:51,600 --> 00:18:52,200
Too slow!

300
00:18:52,660 --> 00:18:54,300
Now give me 3,000 push-ups!

301
00:18:54,860 --> 00:18:55,960
Damn it!

302
00:18:57,160 --> 00:19:00,040
70 kilometers to go in, oh, say, three hours?

303
00:19:00,400 --> 00:19:01,320
Should be a breeze.

304
00:19:02,020 --> 00:19:02,700
Seriously?

305
00:19:02,700 --> 00:19:03,200
Seriously?

306
00:19:14,200 --> 00:19:14,740
Hey!

307
00:19:15,000 --> 00:19:15,600
We're here!

308
00:19:16,260 --> 00:19:16,960
Come on!

309
00:19:17,120 --> 00:19:18,820
Help me look for a department store!

310
00:19:20,400 --> 00:19:21,540
Just like we thought.

311
00:19:21,660 --> 00:19:23,060
They're only selling cards here.

312
00:19:23,480 --> 00:19:24,500
Sorry for the wait.

313
00:19:24,780 --> 00:19:26,980
Now, let's head back to that rocky area.

314
00:19:27,480 --> 00:19:27,980
What?

315
00:19:27,980 --> 00:19:32,920
Gain!

316
00:19:35,320 --> 00:19:38,240
Wait, these are the cards you bought at the department store?

317
00:19:38,400 --> 00:19:38,960
Sure are.

318
00:19:39,620 --> 00:19:41,620
Okay, let's head back to Masadora now.

319
00:19:42,120 --> 00:19:44,820
But this time, we go in a straight line.

320
00:19:45,260 --> 00:19:47,020
Wait, a straight line, huh?

321
00:19:47,240 --> 00:19:48,680
But you don't mean...

322
00:19:48,680 --> 00:19:49,640
I do!

323
00:19:50,200 --> 00:19:52,420
It's time to start digging!

324
00:19:52,420 --> 00:19:58,180
Not as hard as I was expecting.

325
00:19:58,680 --> 00:20:01,160
Yeah, it should go pretty smoothly if this keeps up.

326
00:20:14,300 --> 00:20:15,420
This is rough.

327
00:20:15,500 --> 00:20:16,940
I can't do anymore.

328
00:20:18,440 --> 00:20:19,700
What are you doing?

329
00:20:19,940 --> 00:20:21,360
Sit up if you're gonna rest.

330
00:20:21,360 --> 00:20:25,100
Starting today, this is how you sleep.

331
00:20:25,440 --> 00:20:26,560
Don't let go of the rope.

332
00:20:27,020 --> 00:20:28,700
There's always a chance I might cut it.

333
00:20:29,040 --> 00:20:30,880
So keep part of your brain on high alert,

334
00:20:31,120 --> 00:20:32,080
even when you're sleeping.

335
00:20:33,780 --> 00:20:36,940
My dad used to put me through this kind of training all the time.

336
00:20:36,940 --> 00:20:46,760
Ow, that really hurt!

337
00:20:47,600 --> 00:20:48,740
One more thing.

338
00:20:48,980 --> 00:20:51,240
When it falls, you have to put it back up.

339
00:20:54,680 --> 00:20:56,760
Oh man, your head.

340
00:20:57,180 --> 00:20:58,260
I feel fine.

341
00:20:58,780 --> 00:21:00,400
I'll be making the rocks bigger.

342
00:21:00,400 --> 00:21:02,300
I hate going.

343
00:21:02,720 --> 00:21:03,800
I said I'm fine!

344
00:21:11,800 --> 00:21:14,220
This rock is a lot harder than the rest of it.

345
00:21:14,600 --> 00:21:15,860
Maybe we can dig it up.

346
00:21:17,180 --> 00:21:18,980
I don't think the shovel's gonna work.

347
00:21:19,200 --> 00:21:22,540
But I think it might be possible for me to bust it open with a Nen Punch.

348
00:21:23,380 --> 00:21:24,080
What's wrong?

349
00:21:24,080 --> 00:21:27,260
Killua, what are you doing with your aura when you're digging?

350
00:21:27,700 --> 00:21:29,780
Nothing that's out of the ordinary, I guess.

351
00:21:30,000 --> 00:21:32,480
Try thinking of the shovel as an extension of your body.

352
00:21:32,480 --> 00:21:35,380
I see.

353
00:21:35,920 --> 00:21:37,900
If we envelop the shovel in aura,

354
00:21:38,320 --> 00:21:39,720
our digging will be enhanced.

355
00:21:41,960 --> 00:21:44,380
Wow, it's like the rocks made of custard!

356
00:21:44,900 --> 00:21:46,860
Okay, then let's keep digging.

357
00:21:47,480 --> 00:21:50,420
It sounds like they've learned a new application of ten.

358
00:21:50,840 --> 00:21:51,240
Shoot!

359
00:21:52,640 --> 00:21:56,440
They'll complete the first phase by the time we reach Masadora.

360
00:21:56,440 --> 00:22:02,940
Bisky's grueling training process is underway.

361
00:22:03,480 --> 00:22:06,860
But how it will affect the boys remains to be seen.

362
00:22:26,440 --> 00:22:28,860
Water in army No.

363
00:22:43,100 --> 00:22:44,900
Damage 2

364
00:22:44,980 --> 00:22:47,380
向かい風としていながら

365
00:22:47,380 --> 00:22:50,840
それでも進む 理由がある

366
00:22:50,840 --> 00:23:16,840
Oh!

367
00:23:18,380 --> 00:23:20,580
Coming up!

368
00:23:20,580 --> 00:23:21,420
Tutorial!

